    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Collins O’Meara Auctioneers are delighted to introduce this charming three bedroom cottage in the heart of the Blackwater Valley.  Perched on a 0.5 acre site, the cottage extends to 806 sq. feet. Whilst in need of some modernisation and upgrading, this property offers endless potential  for prospective buyers and is sure to appeal to all sectors of the property market.  Conveniently located within 3 km of Ballyduff village and a mere 6 km from Kilworth village.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen\t\r\n4.12m x 4.08m\t\r\nTimber effect floor, floor and eye level units, power points, plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\t\r\n4.33m x 3.51m\t\r\nTimber floor, open fire with brick surround, power points, phone point.\r\n\r\nPorch\t\r\n2.61m x 2.27m\t\r\nConcrete floor, front door access.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n4.35m x 2.86m\t\r\nTimber floor, power points, dual window aspect.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n2.87m x 2.07m\t\r\nConcrete floor, power points.\r\n\r\nBedroom\r\n2.87m x 2.08m\t\r\nConcrete floor, power points.\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\r\n2.42m x 1.84m\t\r\nTile floor, shower unit with electric shower, W.H.B., W.C.\r\n\r\nServices:\t\r\nMains Water\r\nSeptic Tank\r\nNo Heating System\r\n\r\nEircode:\tP51 H297\r\n\r\nSome images in this advertisement are AI-generated artist's impressions showing potential renovation and landscaping concepts and are provided for illustrative purposes only.  They do not depict the property's current condition, and necessary planning guidance should always be obtained prior to undertaking any works."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Elevated 0.5 acre site with ample outdoor space.\r\n-Peaceful rural setting nestled in the picturesque Blackwater Valley.\r\n-Convenient access to Ballyduff, Kilworth, Fermoy and M8 motorway.\r\n-Excellent renovation opportunity to create a bespoke country home.\r\n-Traditional cottage with character and scope to extend (subject to planning permission)."
      },
